    "description": "Set of three vintage Carter sterling silver weighted candlestick holders, pattern #2593. Each measures approximately 5” tall with a 4” diameter base and features an elegant pedestal form with pierced/reticulated detailing around the candle cup and a decorative border around the base.\n\nMarked on the underside “Carter Sterling  Cement Filled  Reinforced  2593.” These are genuine sterling silver pieces with cement-filled weighted bases, a traditional construction used to provide stability.\n\nThe set displays an attractive aged patina with visible tarnish, surface wear, and signs of use consistent with age. They have not been polished, allowing the buyer to retain the original patina or polish them to their preference.\nIncludes all three candlestick holders shown.",
