    "description": "Eaton 1200A Automatic Transfer Switch – Reliable Power Switching\nEnsure seamless and dependable power transitions with this Eaton 1200A, 4-Pole, Open Transition Automatic Transfer Switch. Built for efficiency and reliability, this unit is well-suited for commercial and industrial power systems requiring safe and continuous operation.\nKey Features\nAmperage: 1200A\nConfiguration: 4-Pole, Open Transition\nEnclosure: NEMA 3R / service entrance, front-accessible design\nStandards: UL 1008 certified\nCondition: Used/Operational – Installed July 2024, in service until May 2025. This switch was originally purchased for $25,000 and remains in excellent condition, ready to provide reliable performance for your facility.\nBuyer is responsible for arranging pickup or shipping.\nVoltage: this ATS is field-selectable for 208/240/480V via the multi-tap control transformer and controller reprogramming. It does not convert a 480V source to 208V. Catalog family ASAP-ATC3C3X41200XRU / ATC3C3C41200XRU, factory 480V.",
